WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:11.617
One day a farmer planted a turnip seed.

2
00:00:11.618 --> 00:00:16.273
Farmer: Turnip, grow big and grow strong!

3
00:00:16.274 --> 00:00:22.887
Woman: Hmmm, he talks to that turnip every day.

4
00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:25.975
Finally the turnip was ready.

5
00:00:25.976 --> 00:00:28.319
The farmer pulled the turnip.

6
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.769
But the turnip didn't move.

7
00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:37.978
Farmer: Help me pull the turnip!

8
00:00:37.979 --> 00:00:39.891
Woman: Pull harder!

9
00:00:39.892 --> 00:00:44.533
Farmer: I'm pulling very hard!

10
00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:51.454
But the turnip didn't move.

11
00:00:51.455 --> 00:00:53.574
Boy: What are you doing?

12
00:00:53.575 --> 00:00:56.090
Farmer: We're pulling this turnip.

13
00:00:56.091 --> 00:01:01.884
Boy: My dog and I can help you.

14
00:01:01.885 --> 00:01:04.089
Dog: I'm pulling the boy.

15
00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:06.251
Boy: I'm pulling the woman.

16
00:01:06.252 --> 00:01:08.750
Woman: I'm pulling my husband.

17
00:01:08.751 --> 00:01:11.833
Farmer: And I'm pulling the turnip.

18
00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:16.959
But the turnip didn't move.

19
00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:20.259
Dog: Hey! Come and help us!

20
00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:22.687
Cat: What are you doing?

21
00:01:22.688 --> 00:01:25.828
Dog: We're pulling this turnip!

22
00:01:25.829 --> 00:01:27.868
Farmer: Okay, everyone!

23
00:01:27.869 --> 00:01:31.176
Let's count to three.

24
00:01:31.177 --> 00:01:37.849
One, two, three!

25
00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:41.379
The turnip moved a little bit.

26
00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:43.474
Farmer: Let's give up.

27
00:01:43.475 --> 00:01:46.954
Woman: Maybe the turnip is too big.

28
00:01:46.955 --> 00:01:55.312
Boy: Maybe the turnip is too heavy.

29
00:01:55.313 --> 00:01:57.525
Mouse: What are you doing?

30
00:01:57.526 --> 00:02:00.551
Cat: We're trying to pull this turnip.

31
00:02:00.552 --> 00:02:03.625
Mouse: I can help you.

32
00:02:03.626 --> 00:02:09.985
Others: You? A little mouse?

33
00:02:09.986 --> 00:02:14.460
Farmer: If we work together, we can pull this turnip out.

34
00:02:14.461 --> 00:02:18.402
Boy: Let's try one more time.

35
00:02:18.403 --> 00:02:20.655
Woman: Is everyone ready?

36
00:02:20.656 --> 00:02:23.253
Everyone: Ready!

37
00:02:23.254 --> 00:02:26.785
Farmer: Come on! Pull!

38
00:02:26.786 --> 00:02:30.408
Woman: Harder! Heave-ho!

39
00:02:30.409 --> 00:02:33.598
Boy: I think it's moving!

40
00:02:33.599 --> 00:02:36.705
Dog: Ouch! My tail!

41
00:02:36.706 --> 00:02:40.586
Cat: Stop moaning! Pull!

42
00:02:40.587 --> 00:02:46.759
Mouse: The turnip is moving!

43
00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:49.381
Mouse: We did it together!

44
00:02:49.382 --> 00:02:52.741
Dog: We make a good team.

45
00:02:52.742 --> 00:02:55.651
Farmer: Tomorrow I will plant pumpkins.

46
00:02:55.652 --> 00:03:03.256
Is that a good idea?
